  "text": "Richmond County Board of Elections | Richmond County, NC - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account\n- Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nDepartments\nServices\nBusiness\nCommunity\nHow Do I\nHome\nDepartments\nBoard of Elections\nRichmond County Board of Elections\nImportant Dates\nEarly Voting for November 3, 2026, General Election, begins October 15, 2026, and ends October 31, 2026.\nEarly Voting Schedule: October 15, 2026- October 31, 2026\nWeekdays- 8 am - 7:30 pm\nSaturday, October 31, 2026- 8 am - 3 pm\nLocation:\nNew Richmond County Board of Elections Office (Move to occur August 2026)\n190 Midway Rd. Rockingham, NC 28379 (Previously, Pee Dee Electric)\nNovember 3, 2026, General Election\nElection Day precincts open 6:30 am - 7:30 pm\nUse the\nVoter Search Tool\nto find your precinct or call the Richmond County Board of Elections at 910-997-8253.\nYou can also use the\nVoter Search Tool\nto view your Sample Ballot\nSample Ballots\nRichmond_Sample Ballot_11032026\nCandidate List\nhttps://www.ncsbe.gov/results-data/candidate-lists\n2026 Candidate Guide\n2026 Candidate Guide\nPhoto ID Notice\nContact Us\nShannon R. Hearne\nDirector of Elections\n190 Midway Rd.\nPost Office Box 1843\nRockingham, North Carolina 28380\n910-997-8253\nFax 910-417-4900\nshannon.hearne@richmondnc.com\nHours:\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nGet Directions\nAbout Us\nAbsentee Voting\nAbsentee by Mail Voting\nAbsentee by Mail Request Form\nMilitary and Overseas Voting\nBoard Meeting Schedule\nBuffer Zone Notice\nCandidate Information\nEarly Voting\nElected Officials\nElection Notice\nElection Results\nForms\nNorth Carolina State Board of Elections\nPart-Time Opportunities\nPrecinct Officials\nPrecincts and Polling Places\nVoter ID Information\nVoter Registration\nVoter Registration Form\nVoter Registration Statistics\nCheck My Registration\nFind My Polling Place\nJOBS\nGIS\nONLINE BILL PAY\nCONTACT US\nMEETINGS & AGENDAS\nContact Us\nAdministration Building\n1401 Fayetteville Road\nRockingham, NC 28379\nPhone:\n910-997-8200\nQuick Links\nRichmond County Economic Development\nRichmond Community College\nRichmond County Schools\nThe City of Hamlet, NC\nThe City of Rockingham, NC\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nBoards & Commissions\nSocial Media\nUpcoming Events\nReceive Alerts\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
